            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AnnieAcco"
            },
            "reviewBody": "THANK YOU! I am AnnieAcco, the original poster, and today,on October 27, 2023, I just decided to look this up. I truly was overwhelmed by the number of positive ratings for this salad dressing. Oh, how I wish that my Sicilian grandma were alive to see this. I appreciate the kindly stated additions to this recipe by some of the posters are. That is the great part about this recipe - if you like more balsamic vinegar - more olive oil - that is your choice. If you like herbs along with the salt and pepper - that is your choice. But, like so many posters say...it is clean and crisp, and NO preservatives.. Buono Appetito to all of you. Best wishes - AnnieAcco",
            "datePublished": "2023-10-27T16:12:23.513Z"
          },
